Shadowy Figure: Uranus and Saturn are now free from the clutches of our enemy. The higher ups are really happy with your progress. Soon the solar system will be ours and we will stand united against those pests who are trying to take what is ours. Unfortunately, we’ve lost our scouts near on the other side of the asteroid belt near Earth Mars Venus Mercury. Before we lost contact. The higher ups agreed that you are more than capable to investigate what happened to our scouts. Report back if you find anything
You: 
