- Who are these pests? 
	Shawdowy Figure: Do not worry about them. They are just lifeforms that are impossible to get rid of but we have a plan. We just need to reach the Sun => Dialogue
- What happened to the scouts?
	Shadowy Figure:  We have no idea. They went to scout Earth and have not reported back. => Dialogue
- How come I don't have guns on my ship? 
	Shadowy Figure: Physical damage does more damage than measly lasers. It's super effective. We measured the power level to be over 9000. => Dialogue
